{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#card-zh","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 是一个面向 DSH 的剪贴板工具插件：它通过注册模型工具接入 DSH 的工具系统，让 agent 读取用户刚复制的文本或截图，也能把生成内容放回系统剪贴板。主要功能包括读取文本并按长度截断、将剪贴板图片保存到工作区、复制文字或文本文件内容，以及复制图片文件。它适合需要在 DSH 会话与其他应用之间传递文本或图像的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；需要可用的系统剪贴板后端，Linux 需安装相应剪贴板助手。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-29","lib/tools.js:99-138","lib/tools.js:141-194","lib/clipboard.js:522-580"]}
{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#card-en","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools adds clipboard tools to DSH. An agent can read copied text or screenshots, and copy inline text, text files, or images for pasting into other apps. It uses the system clipboard and needs no API key or external account. Linux requires a compatible clipboard helper.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:15-29","lib/tools.js:99-138","lib/tools.js:141-194","lib/clipboard.js:522-580"]}
