{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#feature-1","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 的功能「读取剪贴板」：从系统剪贴板读取文本，auto 模式在文本为空时尝试读取图片。调用 clipboard_read，可选 text、image 或 auto 格式；文本会按上限截断并返回状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:99-138"]}
{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#feature-2","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 的功能「保存剪贴板截图」：clipboard_read 读取图片时会将 PNG 保存到 agent 工作区指定目录，并返回文件路径和可解析的尺寸，供后续图像工具读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:118-137"]}
{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#feature-3","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 的功能「复制文本」：调用 clipboard_write 并提供文字或文本文件路径，就会将对应内容写入系统剪贴板，方便在其他应用粘贴。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:197-218"]}
{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#feature-4","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 的功能「复制图片」：调用 clipboard_write 并提供工作区图片路径，可将图片文件写入系统剪贴板；不支持的系统后端会返回错误信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:181-194","lib/clipboard.js:487-512"]}
{"unit_id":"kohjuz__dsh-clipboard-tools#caveat-1","repo":"kohjuz/dsh-clipboard-tools","commit":"d08e229e2e74d42f5eeffed33f6f88a1a664d281","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clipboard-tools 使用前须知：读取到的图片会写入 agent 工作区；Linux 图片读写需要 wl-clipboard 或 xclip，xsel 后端只支持文本操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:124-128","lib/clipboard.js:487-512"]}
